  talkFramerate: 6
  adviceLines:
  - '* Say,^05 I hear there''s a strange\n  scientist near the library.'
  - '* He looks eerily similar to\n  one of the residents here.'
  - '* Maybe he has the key to\n  the answers of why you''re\n  here...'
  - '* ...^05 or possibly just the\n  key to someone''s house.'
